# --- server multi-stage build: context is repo root, trim big/irrelevant/secret paths ---
# Host NuGet.Config pins a Windows-only offline source that breaks Linux container restore.
# Excluding it lets the SDK image restore from nuget.org.
NuGet.Config
**/publish
release
installer
.dotnet
.dotnet-cli
.license-signing
design
docs
tools
