db
# The bot's real config and its order history are untracked files that exist only on a dev machine.
# Without these lines a local build bakes the live BotFather and Crypto Pay tokens into an image
# layer, and appsettings.json is copied to the output directory by the csproj, so it would also
# silently win over the environment variables the compose service sets.
CryptoAITerminal.LicenseBot/appsettings.json
CryptoAITerminal.LicenseBot/licensebot.db
CryptoAITerminal.LicenseBot/licensebot.db-wal
CryptoAITerminal.LicenseBot/licensebot.db-shm
!**/.gitignore
!.git/HEAD
!.git/config
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads/**